WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.829 --> 00:00:03.496
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.550
- Hollywood is simply one of
the coolest places in Cali.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.100
It happens to be where
I was born and raised

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.123
and lived my whole life
in the 90046 area code.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:20.930
There are so many reasons
to visit this area.

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:23.590
The iconic Hollywood sign
is certainly one of them,

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.740
but there is amazing food

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.200
and interesting
neighborhoods to walk around

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:32.110
and old Spanish Hollywood
architecture to marvel at.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:35.630
By the way, could you
tell I'm from California?

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:39.900
I mean, I am stuck with this
accent for my whole life

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.230
and I couldn't be more proud.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.980
If there's anything
more Cali about someone

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:48.370
than this kind of accent,
I'd like to meet them.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:52.437
Drew's Cali is sponsored
by Visit California.

00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:55.937
(upbeat music continues)

